WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Narrator: When Civil Defence arrive at a fire, they take command.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:15.100
Narrator: If one of their officers asks you to move people back or keep a route open - something within your role - confirm it and do it straight away.

3
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.000
Narrator: Then tell your supervisor what you were asked to do.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.700
Narrator: If you're asked to do something outside your role, or two instructions don't match, tell them and check through your supervisor - but keep people safe while you do.

5
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:36.500
Narrator: Remember, command can change as an incident grows - the VOC will tell your chain.

